         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nIn this text, we will practice the addition operation. Before starting, we suggest studying the texts from Chapter 3 of the *First Steps* section of **History Tracers** (<htcite0>).",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "b5efc8f9-c268-430f-9681-7a43848ee48e",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "First steps (Volume 1)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
